{"id":"cd71da66769f105b","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-prim-consistency.md","title":"Proof-Code Consistency","display":"df-prim-consistency — Proof-Code Consistency","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-prim-consistency","aliases":["67-df-prim-consistency"],"display":"df-prim-consistency — Proof-Code Consistency","depends_on":["[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-proof-predicate]]","[[67-df-godel-encoding]]"],"verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14","inherited_verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","inherited_source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-prim-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-prim-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prim-consistency — Proof-Code Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"be38aee184dd1b06\" href=\"?note=be38aee184dd1b06\" title=\"67-df-proof-predicate\">67-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮检查形式陈述、类型和依赖；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为有效一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 固定有效公理呈示及其证明码关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_T\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be38aee184dd1b06\" href=\"?note=be38aee184dd1b06\" title=\"67-df-proof-predicate\">67-df-proof-predicate</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 是该证明呈示使用的同一编号，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)\">\\(\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimCon}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimCon}\\)</span> 为下式定义的外部谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimCon}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,g(\\bot_L)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimCon}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,g(\\bot_L)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>By <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a>, this code-level formulation is extensionally equivalent to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"be38aee184dd1b06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"be38aee184dd1b06","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为有效一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 固定有效公理呈示及其证明码关系 $\\mathrm{Proof}_T$，见 [[67-df-proof-predicate]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g$ 是该证明呈示使用的同一编号，见 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]；$\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)$ 取 [[67-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{PrimCon}$ 为下式定义的外部谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$g$ 是该证明呈示使用的同一编号，见 [[67-df-godel-encoding]]；$\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)$ 取 [[67-df-formula]]。$\\mathrm{PrimCon}$ 为下式定义的外部谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"By [[67-df-consistent]], this code-level formulation is extensionally equivalent to $\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)$.","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_T","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot_L=\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimCon}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimCon}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall p\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Proof}_T(p,g(\\bot_L)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)","display":false}],"bytes":1430,"backlinks":[{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-prim-consistency]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-prim-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["2035a1f4d72e7df9","be38aee184dd1b06","e5654af7c954e1c0","9f0e08fd1022847c"]}